Query: issue_type?, severity?, resolution_status?

/// Test: Get exception by ID
GET /exceptions/{exception_id}
Auth: Bearer {{auth.token}}

/// Test: Create exception (auto-created when blocked decision)
POST /exceptions/
Auth: Bearer {{auth.token}}
Body:
{
  "issue_type": "PRICE_BELOW_FLOOR",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "sku": "SKU-000001",
  "description": "Price below minimum margin floor",
  "expected_behavior": "Price should be >= floor",
  "actual_behavior": "Price was set below floor"
}
Response: Created exception record

